OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy for much of Thursday,
OL,6,Fwith most areas staying dry until a
OL,7,Fband of rain moves southeastwards
OL,8,Facross the region later in the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Breezy throughout and mild.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThe cloud and rain will
OL,12,Fslowly move southeastwards overnight
OL,13,Fbecoming heavy at times. With clear
OL,14,Fskies developing behind and across the
OL,15,Fregion by dawn, allowing temperatures
OL,16,Fto readily fall.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
