OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA cool start to the morning
OL,6,Funder clear skies. Becoming cloudy
OL,7,Fwith the chance of some showers
OL,8,Fdeveloping during the afternoon,
OL,9,Fmainly over high ground and along the
OL,10,Fcoast.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCooler
OL,13,Fthrough this period, with sunny spells
OL,14,Fand showers. Showers most frequent
OL,15,Fnear the coast, though occasionally
OL,16,Fspreading inland. Winds mostly light,
OL,17,Fbut breezy at times near coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
